{title: Un Mele Oru Kannu}
{artist: Rajinimurugan}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Un mela oru [F]kannu Nee,        [Dm]thaan en mora [Bb]ponnu
[Dm]onnoda iva [F]onnu onna,        [Dm]marantha verum [Bb]mannu
[F]irukkuren [C]onnala,        [F]parakkuren [Am]thannaala
[Bb]keranguren [Gm]Norunguren,        [Bb]paaru naan un [Dm]maapula
[Dm]Konjunaa minjura [Dm]minjuna konjura,        [F]yean di indha [C]naadagam
[Dm]kenjuna anjura [Dm]anjuna kenjura,        [F]naalum unga [C]nyabagam
[Dm]sollaama [Bb]kollama [Am]moodi vachu,        enna [C]angeyum ingeyum [Am]alayavitta
[Dm]allama [Bb]killama [Am]noga vacchu enna,        [C]munnaalum [F]pinnaalum [Am]monaga vitta
[Bb]othukitta [C]maamanthaan,        [Am]kattikka [Dm]vaaren vaaren
